<body>

<div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h2>🕸️ HiveMind 知识关系图谱</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">探索知识节点之间的复杂关系和内在联系</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <div class="controls">
                <div class="search-box">
                    <label>搜索节点:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="search-input" placeholder="输入节点名称..." onkeyup="searchNodes()">
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="clearSearch()">清除</button>
                </div>

                <div class="filter-group">
                    <label>节点类型:</label>
                    <select id="node-type-filter" onchange="filterByType()">
                        <option value="">全部</option>
                        <option value="concept">核心概念</option>
                        <option value="domain">应用领域</option>
                        <option value="tool">技术工具</option>
